{
  "version": "iui/1",
  "title": "排列控件不改变它们的状态与领域",
  "description": "原创本地合成示例；计划字段与计时相互独立，不联网保存。",
  "theme": "auto",
  "state": {
    "sets": 3
  },
  "body": [
    {
      "type": "flow",
      "justify": "start",
      "children": [
        {
          "type": "icon",
          "name": "warning",
          "tone": "warning"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "value": "开始计时后，不要为改变状态点而反复update整份文档。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "form",
      "label": "练习计划",
      "children": [
        {
          "type": "flow",
          "align": "end",
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "input",
              "kind": "number",
              "label": "组数",
              "bind": "sets",
              "min": 1,
              "max": 8,
              "step": 1
            },
            {
              "type": "metric",
              "label": "当前组数",
              "value": {
                "$": "sets"
              },
              "unit": "组"
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "submitLabel": "检查计划",
      "cancelLabel": "恢复计划"
    },
    {
      "type": "timer",
      "title": "两分钟页内练习",
      "durationMs": 120000
    },
    {
      "type": "pulse-indicator",
      "label": "合成说明状态，不随计时变化",
      "status": "idle",
      "animate": false
    },
    {
      "type": "popover",
      "label": "为什么状态点不自动改变？",
      "title": "不同层次的状态",
      "children": [
        {
          "type": "flow",
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "icon",
              "name": "info"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "value": "pulse-indicator的status是字面值，timer持有独立本地状态。flow只负责按顺序换行。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "caption",
      "value": "此文档需要base＋forms＋time。把form/time放入base的flow或popover，不会免去对应领域合同。"
    }
  ]
}
